cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the model it implements, please cite the paper."
title: "AMR Engine — The Architecture of Market Regimes"
abstract: >-
  A runnable implementation of "The Architecture of Market Regimes: Modeling DXY
  through Structural and Reflexive Layers", with a corrected and empirically
  fitted variant (amr2) and a geometric re-reading that measures path dependence
  (amr3).
authors:
